 0A000 | 0A000 | ok |  | 
 22000 | 22000 | ok |  | 
 54000 | 54000 | ok |  | 
 55000 | 55000 | ok |  | 
 59000 | 59000 | ok |  | 
 F1000 | F1000 | ok |  | 
 XY000 | XY000 | ok |  | 
 P0003 | P0003 | ok |  | 
 ZZZZZ | ZZZZZ | ok |  | 
 99999 | 99999 | ok |  | 
(12 rows)

